crates/amb-engine/src/xtrans.rs is ported from darktable
(src/iop/demosaicing/xtrans.c), Copyright (C) 2010-2026 darktable developers,
GPL-3.0-or-later, which adapts dcraw 9.20's X-Trans interpolation by Dave
Coffin and Frank Markesteijn.

crates/amb-engine/src/rcd.rs implements Ratio Corrected Demosaicing (RCD)
v2.3 by Luis Sanz Rodríguez (GPL-3.0, github.com/LuisSR/RCD-Demosaicing),
following RawTherapee's rtengine/rcd_demosaic.cc and darktable's
src/iop/demosaicing/rcd.c (both GPL-3.0-or-later).


